{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Context\n\nF25 and F27 are approved. Exit-code guidance omits the completion path marked verdict_obtainable=false. Five public mutation wrappers lack client-facing documentation following the library write-surface split.\n\n## Plan\n\n- Document retryable raised LLMError failures and results marked verdict_obtainable=false as exit 11.\n- Distinguish those paths from ordinary completion failure and nonretryable indeterminate outcomes.\n- Document unlink, tag, untag, archive, and compact signatures, effects, errors, repository selection, event or storage effects, and publication behavior.\n- Remove stale shell-history narration where it obscures current compact behavior.\n- Compare each documentation statement with its named code path or public signature.\n- Change no public behavior.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] docs/exit-codes.md documents exit 11 for a retryable LLMError raised during completion verification.\n- [ ] docs/exit-codes.md documents exit 11 when bounded completion recovery returns verdict_obtainable=false.\n- [ ] Ordinary completion failure and nonretryable indeterminate outcomes remain distinct.\n- [ ] Public docstrings in src/rebar/_lib_mutations.py cover each named mutation wrapper.\n- [ ] docs/reuse-surface.md covers each named mutation wrapper.\n- [ ] Reviewer inspection confirms that the documentation matches the named code paths and signatures.\n- [ ] The commands in Verification pass.\n- [ ] No public behavior changes.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_exit_codes.py tests/interfaces/facades/test_leaf_writes_parity.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make typecheck`\n- Review docs/exit-codes.md against `src/rebar/_cli/_llm_commands.py::_verify_completion` and `src/rebar/_commands/close_precheck.py::_completion_precheck`.\n- Review docs/reuse-surface.md and each public docstring against the corresponding signature in src/rebar/_lib_mutations.py."}},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1787591468746521001,"uuid":"5b3dddda-2ca5-46fd-95a0-4f0c2e3a73ad"}